      "writtenOn": "2022-04-19T04:42:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this ordering is potentially problematic, since the following program order is possible:\n\n1. Disable high trigger\n2. Enable low trigger\n3. Low trigger fires, clearing ADC_BIT_VALUE\n4. This function sets ADC_BIT_VALUE\n\nThat would leave the value high but last interrupt low; any changes to the ADC_BIT_VALUE need to occur with the threshold interrupts blocked (disable high, set bit, enable low and similar in trigger_low).",
      "revId": "e55b6cf9b3aaa4c7a321e4d5d31d0dedc37720af",
